<div style="background-color:#000000;clear:both;height:2pt;page-break-after:always;width:79.3%;border:0;margin:30pt 10.35% 30pt 10.35%;"></div><div style="max-width:100%;padding-left:10.35%;padding-right:10.35%;position:relative;"><div style="margin-top:21.6pt;min-height:41.75pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;line-height:1.19;margin:0pt 0pt 30pt 0pt;"><a href="#Toc"><span style="font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Table of Contents</span></a></p><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;line-height:1.19;text-align:center;margin:0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">TTEC HOLDINGS,&#160;INC. AND SUBSIDIARIES</b></p><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;line-height:1.19;text-align:center;margin:0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">Notes to Consolidated Financial Statements</b></p><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;line-height:1.19;text-align:center;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">(Unaudited)</b></p></div><div style="clear:both;max-width:100%;position:relative;"><a id="_1f75b279_d094_438a_b2ba_8c02349e94a4"></a><a id="Tc_UJAZaeX1K02C8n16edNdzA_1_2"></a><a id="Tc_FN55bxj5gUqn-EXTRFdxDg_1_8"></a><a id="Tc_Moopb8m7nkKkPuGX40tS9Q_2_2"></a><a id="Tc_MPO1za9kmkiV1ZCnjC4UYw_2_5"></a><a id="Tc_2X42UWCpNkepq5KvpRvctA_2_8"></a><a id="Tc_7H4Ge6TzgUWk7na694Q6UA_2_11"></a><a id="Tc_BF5HYweO2kykMTI8jHrRtQ_3_0"></a><a id="Tc_Qa8b361sQEilIOpTClEo0Q_3_2"></a><a id="Tc_0aaxK2biq0WxYYA3u-Rq5A_3_5"></a><a id="Tc_fgEFijy5r0mvY5W3wGXOGg_3_8"></a><a id="Tc_9b0MPVkzBkS7hGxo3yP9uQ_3_11"></a><a id="Tc_PNkC2bif-ESkntiYV0rHUw_4_0"></a><a id="Tc_u-deEVKSKkChd21BUbzOZw_5_0"></a><a id="Tc_RuAJ8eGNC0ua8v2_-OTU7Q_6_0"></a><a id="Tc_nYchbQsMYUClEXfVbklLWA_6_2"></a><a id="Tc_1n3-hImFAU62pYMv0OkIdA_6_5"></a><a id="Tc_0ZkXrPb5X0qfWnn3zoZtdg_6_8"></a><a id="Tc_RtRzUVeNsE2QdjkZrbaqLQ_6_11"></a><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2026_To_6_30_2026_DiCI9Vcfg0GQQ1BvhN9acg" name="us-gaap:LoansNotesTradeAndOtherReceivablesDisclosureTextBlock" id="Tb_edOFnXBkwkO3B7T-tDPpTQ" escape="true"><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;line-height:1.19;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 6pt 0pt;"><span style="display:inline-block;text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;width:36pt;"><b style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:bold;">(3)</b></span><b style="font-weight:bold;">SIGNIFICANT CLIENTS AND OTHER CONCENTRATIONS</b></p><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;line-height:1.19;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 6pt 0pt;">The Company had <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2026_To_6_30_2026_srt_MajorCustomersAxis_ttec_AutomotiveIndustryClientMember_us-gaap_ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis_us-gaap_SalesMember_us-gaap_ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis_us-gaap_CustomerConcentrationRiskMember_6_V2yqoZu0WMI-c-PIUjrg" name="us-gaap:ConcentrationRiskCustomer" id="Narr_sUfsJMly60a1-w5aD_s9NA">one</ix:nonNumeric> client that contributed in excess of 10% of total revenue for the six months ended June&#160;30, 2026; this client operates in the automotive industry and is included in the TTEC Engage segment. This client contributed <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_3p-U5h7CjU2YamFApOCinQ" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2026_To_6_30_2026_srt_MajorCustomersAxis_ttec_AutomotiveIndustryClientMember_us-gaap_ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis_us-gaap_SalesMember_us-gaap_ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis_us-gaap_CustomerConcentrationRiskMember_6_V2yqoZu0WMI-c-PIUjrg" decimals="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ConcentrationRiskPercentage1" scale="-2" id="Narr_iMiffCMcMkezq-VOvWJMDg">12.1</ix:nonFraction>% and <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_3p-U5h7CjU2YamFApOCinQ" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_6_30_2025_srt_MajorCustomersAxis_ttec_AutomotiveIndustryClientMember_us-gaap_ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis_us-gaap_SalesMember_us-gaap_ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis_us-gaap_CustomerConcentrationRiskMember_hTo7HQOqiUK-ZTG0XvMroA" decimals="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ConcentrationRiskPercentage1" scale="-2" id="Narr_knjn2z5aI0etCvNaWMh8zw">10.7</ix:nonFraction>% of total revenue for the six months ended June&#160;30, 2026 and 2025, respectively. In addition, the Company has other clients with aggregate revenue exceeding $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_x3Tnpp9ZMEC69lA7e1ChLg" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2026_To_6_30_2026_srt_RangeAxis_srt_MinimumMember_us-gaap_ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis_us-gaap_SalesMember_us-gaap_ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis_us-gaap_CustomerConcentrationRiskMember_VcJFtGmtBkiODSxdaznQ-Q" decimals="-6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:RevenueFromContractWithCustomerExcludingAssessedTax" scale="6" id="Narr_M_CsUgwp1024_-cnvJB1Dw">100</ix:nonFraction> million annually and the loss of one or more of these clients could have a material adverse effect on the Company&#8217;s business, operating results, or financial condition. To mitigate this risk, the Company&#8217;s business arrangements with these larger clients are structured as multiple contracts with different statements of work that are specific to a different line of business or service; these contracts have different durations and renewal dates and could have a revenue opportunity above the $100 million aggregate. </p><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;line-height:1.19;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 6pt 0pt;">To limit the Company&#8217;s credit risk with its clients, management performs periodic credit evaluations, maintains allowances for credit losses and may require pre-payment for services from certain clients whose financial stability or payment practices raise concern. Based on currently available information, management does not believe significant credit risk existed as of June&#160;30, 2026 beyond what was already recognized.</p><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2026_To_6_30_2026_DiCI9Vcfg0GQQ1BvhN9acg" name="us-gaap:AllowanceForCreditLossesOnFinancingReceivablesTableTextBlock" id="Tb_Ga8GkdbEWkOOzoPFiVCFjw" escape="true"><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;line-height:1.19;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 6pt 0pt;">Activity in the Company&#8217;s allowance for credit losses consists of the following (in thousands):</p><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-size:16pt;height:max-content;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;width:100%;"><tr style="height:1pt;"><td style="vertical-align:bottom;width:45.03%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><div style="height:1pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;position:relative;"><div style="bottom:0pt;position:absolute;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;line-height:1.19;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></div></div></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:2.07%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><div style="height:1pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;position:relative;"><div style="bottom:0pt;position:absolute;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;line-height:1.19;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></div></div></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:2.05%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><div style="height:1pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;position:relative;"><div style="bottom:0pt;position:absolute;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;line-height:1.19;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></div></div></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:9.77%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><div style="height:1pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;position:relative;"><div style="bottom:0pt;pos