 hedges are recognized in earnings in Other income (expense), net on a before tax basis and are offset by gains and losses on the related hedged items.</p></ix:continuation></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;line-height:1.19;text-align:center;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">14</p></div></div>
